            │             │           │           │             │
            ▼             ▼           ▼           ▼             ▼
        10 Million       100         5x         1.5x          0.7
        (DAU)           (reads+       (peak     (1.5 years     (30% idle
                         writes)       time)      growth)       headroom)
                         
                         
═══ EXAMPLE CALCULATION ════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Step 1: Base QPS = (DAU × Actions/user/day) / Seconds in day
        Base QPS = (10M × 100) / 86,400 = 11,574 QPS

Step 2: Peak QPS = Base QPS × Peak Factor
        Peak QPS = 11,574 × 5 = 57,870 QPS

Step 3: Future QPS = Peak QPS × Growth Factor
        Future QPS = 57,870 × 1.5 = 86,805 QPS

Step 4: Required Capacity = Future QPS / Safety Margin
        Required Capacity = 86,805 / 0.7 = 124,007 QPS

Step 5: Servers needed = Required Capacity / (QPS per server)
        QPS per server = 5,000
        Servers = 124,007 / 5,000 = 25 servers

